{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18606","headline":"善谑驿和刘梦得酹淳于先生 · 柳宗元","name":"善谑驿和刘梦得酹淳于先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水上鹄已去，亭中鸟又鸣。\n辞因使楚重，名爲救齐成。\n荒壠遽千古，羽觞难再倾。\n刘伶今日意，异代是同声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}